# Dataset metadata
dataset_metadata.json
dataset_manifest.json

# ...except built dataset definitions under data/<name>/ (small JSON, versioned
# on purpose -- a benchmark set every future model is compared against has to be
# frozen and reviewable; see docs/plans/dataset-builder.md).
# Must come after the data/** and dataset_*.json rules above: last match wins.
!data/benchmark*/
!data/benchmark*/dataset_metadata.json
!data/benchmark*/dataset_manifest.json

## ignore agents rules
AGENTS.md